The '''Kalphite Cave''' is a [[dungeons|dungeon]] located east of the [[Shantay Pass]], housing [[kalphites]] that can only be killed while on a [[Slayer task]]. The centre of the cave contains [[kalphite larva]]e. Unlike the [[Kalphite Lair]], a [[rope]] is '''not''' required to access the cave.

Players may enter without a Slayer task, but upon attacking any monster inside the dungeon, [[Buggie]] will stop them from doing so, claiming that they are not assigned to kill them.

A [[dwarf multicannon]] '''can''' be used here, and it is a [[multi-combat area]]. The player does not suffer from [[desert heat]] while within the cave.

{{Map|caption=The entrance to the cave.|x=3320|y=3122|r=4|mtype=square|align=left}}

==Transportation==
*Using a [[desert amulet 4]] teleports the player directly there.
*Using an [[achievement diary cape]] to teleport to the [[Shantay Pass]].
*[[Minigame Teleport|Minigame teleport]] to [[Sorceress's Garden]]
*Using an [[amulet of glory]] to teleport to [[Al Kharid]], then running south.
*Using [[fairy ring]] {{Fairycode|biq}} to teleport to the [[Kalphite Lair]], then run <!-- Note: This is for the cave, not the lair. The cave is north-east and the lair is north-west of the fairy ring. -->north-east.
*Teleporting to the player's [[house]] in [[Pollnivneach]] (or using a [[Pollnivneach teleport]]) and taking the [[magic carpet]] to [[Shantay Pass]].
*Teleport to the [[Emir's Arena]], then run south.
*Using a [[necklace of passage]] to teleport to Eagle's Eyrie, running south to the bridge, and then running north-west.

