==Trivia==
*There is no presence of a queen in the cave, despite the fact that kalphites must always have a queen; if there is no queen in a hive, a larvae would quickly develop into one to fill this role.{{CiteNPC|npc=Kalphite Queen head (mounted)|quote=Yes, you killed this queen, but by now another will have risen up! One kalphite may die but the hive goes on!}} This may be due to how the cave was created unnaturally by the [[Entomologist]], and is colder than the [[Kalphite Lair]].

